`visual.html` written. Here's what the scaffold contains:

**Layout (top to bottom):**
- Sticky `<header>` — navy gradient, Georgia serif title, auth badge + login/logout buttons in top-right
- `<main>` — max-width 1280px, two states:
  - `#auth-gate` — centered sign-in card (shown when unauthenticated)
  - `#dashboard` — hidden until auth; contains status bar, then the five placeholder panels
- `<footer>` — always visible utility strip with controls

**Five placeholder panels with correct IDs:**
| ID | Description |
|----|-------------|
| `#kpi-strip` | Grid row, expands to 4-up KPI cards |
| `#chart-bump` | Left chart panel (bump) |
| `#chart-share` | Right chart panel (share %) |
| `#transition-table` | Full-width table panel |
| `#narrative` | Full-width text panel |

**Footer controls:**
- Year range inputs defaulting to 2021–2025 with "All time (1987–2025)" button
- SQL `<textarea>` prefilled with `main.sql` — the `yearly_carrier` CTE now includes `WHERE Year BETWEEN __START_YEAR__ AND __END_YEAR__`
- Run / Export CSV buttons (disabled until authenticated)
- Query ledger table with collapsible SQL rows (▶/▼ toggle), status dots, and row counts

**Auth & execution:**
- `STORAGE_KEY = 'OnTimeAnalystDashboard::auth::oauth2'`
- Full PKCE flow: `/register` → `/authorize` → `/token` (modeled on `app.html`)
- Callback parsed on page load; URL cleaned via `history.replaceState`
- `execQuery(sql)` uses Bearer token; handles 401/403 by clearing auth and returning to gate
- `applyYearRange(sql)` substitutes both placeholders before every execution
- Monotonic `runCounter` discards stale async completions
- `exportCsv()` RFC-4180 CSV from `lastRows`
